<title>USA: NASD panel nominates former Senator to board.</title>
<headline>NASD panel nominates former Senator to board.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Association of Securities Dealers Inc said its Nominating Committee is recommending the appointment of former U.S. Senator Nancy Kassebaum Baker to the NASD Board of Governors.</p>
<p>The NASD Board of Governors will act upon the recommendation during its regularly scheduled meeting on June 26, the securities industry regulator said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Senator Kassebaum Baker served in the United States Senate from December 1978 to January 1997 and continues to serve on several other boards and foundations.</p>
</text>
